### Get all blogs
GET http://localhost:3003/api/blogs

###

### Create a new blog
POST http://localhost:3003/api/blogs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "My First Blog Post",
  "author": "John Doe",
  "url": "https://example.com/my-first-blog",
  "likes": 0
}

###

### Create another blog
POST http://localhost:3003/api/blogs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Learning Node.js",
  "author": "Jane Smith", 
  "url": "https://example.com/learning-nodejs",
  "likes": 15
}

###

### Create a blog with more likes
POST http://localhost:3003/api/blogs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Advanced Express Patterns",
  "author": "Mike Johnson",
  "url": "https://example.com/advanced-express",
  "likes": 42
}